# EtCard Component - Agent Guide

## Overview

`EtCard` is a basic card component with compound component pattern. It renders children directly for full flexibility, allowing semantic subcomponents (Header, Content, Footer) to be mixed with custom elements.

**Location:** `/libs/etoro-ui/src/components/card/`

## Key Features

- **Compound Component Pattern**: Flexible composition with semantic subcomponents
- **Direct Children Rendering**: Children render in natural JSX order with full flexibility
- **Sentiment-Based Styling**: Background color changes based on `isPositive` prop
- **Halo Effect**: Decorative halo in dark mode for positive/negative sentiment
- **Shadow Styling**: Optional shadow with `shadow` prop (default: true)
- **RTL Ready**: Uses logical properties for future RTL support

## Usage

```tsx
import { EtCard, EtText } from 'etoro-ui';

// Basic usage
<EtCard>
  <EtCard.Header>
    <EtText variant="label-tertiary-semibold">Portfolio Value</EtText>
  </EtCard.Header>
  <EtCard.Content>
    <EtText variant="num-lg">$42,150.23</EtText>
  </EtCard.Content>
  <EtCard.Footer>
    <EtText variant="body-tiny-regular">Updated just now</EtText>
  </EtCard.Footer>
</EtCard>

// With custom elements between sections
<EtCard>
  <EtCard.Header>...</EtCard.Header>
  <View style={styles.divider} />
  <EtCard.Content>...</EtCard.Content>
  <EtCard.Content>...</EtCard.Content>
</EtCard>

// With sentiment
<EtCard isPositive={true}>
  <EtCard.Content>
    <EtText style={{ color: colors.actionBrandText }}>+$1,234.56</EtText>
  </EtCard.Content>
</EtCard>
```

## Subcomponents

| Component | Description                           |
| --------- | ------------------------------------- |
| `Header`  | Semantic container for header content |
| `Content` | Semantic container for main content   |
| `Footer`  | Semantic container for footer content |

All subcomponents are pass-through Views with no default styles - they exist for semantic clarity and can be styled via the `style` prop.

## Props Reference

### EtCardProps (Root)

| Prop         | Type                   | Default     | Description                                                                           |
| ------------ | ---------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `children`   | `ReactNode`            | -           | Card content (subcomponents or any elements)                                          |
| `style`      | `StyleProp<ViewStyle>` | -           | Container style overrides                                                             |
| `shadow`     | `boolean`              | `true`      | Enable shadow styling                                                                 |
| `isPositive` | `boolean \| undefined` | `undefined` | Sentiment: `true` = positive (green), `false` = negative (red), `undefined` = neutral |
| `testID`     | `string`               | -           | Test identifier                                                                       |

### Subcomponent Props (Header, Content, Footer)

| Prop       | Type                   | Description     |
| ---------- | ---------------------- | --------------- |
| `children` | `ReactNode`            | Content         |
| `style`    | `StyleProp<ViewStyle>` | Style overrides |
| `testID`   | `string`               | Test identifier |

### Sentiment Behavior

- **Positive (`isPositive={true}`)**: Green background, green halo in dark mode
- **Negative (`isPositive={false}`)**: Red background, red halo in dark mode
- **Neutral (`isPositive={undefined}`)**: Secondary background, no halo

